# Scope the published ClawHub skill to the MCP server only — the ClawHub mirror
# of package.json "files" (which already scopes the npm package the same way).
#
# These stay in git: the Vercel x402-watch dashboard (web/) and CI build from
# them, and they're never shipped to npm. This file only affects what ClawHub
# packs, so the dashboard + npm package are unaffected.
#
# (clawhub reads .gitignore first, then this file — so node_modules/dist/.env
# are already excluded; here we drop the non-MCP, higher-scope components that
# the security scanner correctly flagged as broader than "subgraph discovery".)

web/          # x402-watch dashboard: payment analytics, /amp Anthropic SQL chat, DuckDB/parquet, S3/AWS
scripts/      # Dune regeneration + payer-wallet attribution (chain log scanning)
python/       # registry crawler / build tooling (not needed at MCP runtime)
docs/
.github/      # CI workflows
*.parquet
